error[retry-write] 2:23-2:76
  (retry {:delays [1s]} (call mail.send {:to "ops@example.com" :subject "x"}))
                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  retry may repeat mail.send, which is a write that is not idempotent, and Timeout and Unavailable leave it unknown whether the write happened.
  Only the kinds RateLimited, NotFound, PermissionDenied, Invalid, and Conflict mean the service did not perform the operation.
  Here :on [RateLimited] alone would be allowed.
  Fix: :on [RateLimited]
  Help: sx help retry
